# WS-7 benchmark evidence is local-only; the result PR rule permits only a
# redaction-safe analyzer summary, never ledgers, markers, raw streams, or solutions.
benchmarks/aqg-workflow/results/
benchmarks/aqg-workflow/results-*/
benchmarks/aqg-workflow/.ws-7-*-denial-smoke-attempt.json

# AQG code construction workspace (per Wave 3 aqg-code-construction skill)
# Holds ledger files (.aqg/code-construction/*.md), local hooks (.aqg/hooks/),
# and current task pointer (.aqg/current_ledger.md). Ephemeral session state
# — durable record lives in PR/commit messages.
.aqg/

# Claude Code local agent state: per-session worktrees (.claude/worktrees/),
# local-only settings (settings.local.json), scheduled-task lockfile, etc.
# Entirely local — 0 tracked files here, never shared/durable.
.claude/
